{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1093870-new-fae-souls","id":1093870,"title":"New Fae Souls","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-17T15:38:29-07:00","id":1093870,"title":"New Fae Souls","content":"So, a quick question. Can there ever be a Changeling with a fresh new soul? ie... can Faeries have a baby that is not an older soul reincarnated?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/769-chris-wilson","name":"Chris Wilson","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"229"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-17T15:42:43-07:00","id":1093872,"title":"","content":"There is one kith in C20 that went through some sort of ritual after the resurgence to change from a species of Chimera to kithain.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10243-zenten","name":"zenten","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10243_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"488"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-18T07:26:37-07:00","id":1094117,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chris Wilson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1093870-new-fae-souls#post1093870\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, a quick question. Can there ever be a Changeling with a fresh new soul? ie... can Faeries have a baby that is not an older soul reincarnated?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Part of the horrible tragedy I highlight in my chronicles is that there aren't any new fae souls being created, so each one that is permanently destroyed by cold iron is another soul of an endangered species being snuffed out.<br /> <br /> But YMMV.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13420-gl1tterboots","name":"gl1tterboots","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"58"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-18T08:11:13-07:00","id":1094135,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>gl1tterboots</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1093870-new-fae-souls?p=1094117#post1094117\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Part of the horrible tragedy I highlight in my chronicles is that there aren't any new fae souls being created, so each one that is permanently destroyed by cold iron is another soul of an endangered species being snuffed out.<br /> <br /> But YMMV.</div> </div> </div> </div>What about the Adhene?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-18T08:36:35-07:00","id":1094153,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1093870-new-fae-souls?p=1094135#post1094135\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What about the Adhene?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think Adhene have only popped up in one of my chronicles. Between the kithain, the inanimae, the thallain, the nunnehi, the menahune, and other gallain like merfolk the cast of characters gets bloated very quickly. I try not to take the &quot;everything but the kitchen sink&quot; approach because I go in with specific themes and stories to tell. The Dark Kin have never really fit well into that framework for me, and I think they'd be best served by a chronicle that focuses on them alone. They operate on a totally different level than kithain and have different themes. The great thing about Changeling (one of the best things about it, imo) is that there is <i>so much variety</i> that compliments so many different stories. We're lucky that we can pick and choose what we want to incorporate.<br /> <br /> So yeah, like I said, YMMV!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13420-gl1tterboots","name":"gl1tterboots","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"58"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-18T17:41:02-07:00","id":1094360,"title":"","content":"What kind of deal would the Changelings need to strike in order to bear children with new Kithain souls and with whom would the deal have to be struck? What kind of cost would the deal incur? An Ifrit maybe? The dreaming itself. Would a nocker have to craft the soul? What part of the dream would have to be sacrificed? <br /> <br /> I think this might make a cool adventure or source book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/769-chris-wilson","name":"Chris Wilson","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"229"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-18T20:26:44-07:00","id":1094403,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chris Wilson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1093870-new-fae-souls?p=1094360#post1094360\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What kind of deal would the Changelings need to strike in order to bear children with new Kithain souls and with whom would the deal have to be struck? What kind of cost would the deal incur? An Ifrit maybe? The dreaming itself. Would a nocker have to craft the soul? What part of the dream would have to be sacrificed?<br /> <br /> I think this might make a cool adventure or source book.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Completely in the realm of Storyteller fiat. Changelings don't give birth to Changelings (except for when they do because magic).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13420-gl1tterboots","name":"gl1tterboots","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"58"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-19T02:35:49-07:00","id":1094470,"title":"","content":"I've often wondered this; does a child of the fae have to be an old soul returned? I've seen nothing to indicate that here is a finite number of fae souls, so I MUST assume that new fae souls are possible.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3988-windthin","name":"Windthin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3988_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-19T06:41:58-07:00","id":1094518,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Windthin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1093870-new-fae-souls?p=1094470#post1094470\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">so I MUST assume that new fae souls are possible.</div> </div> </div> </div>Possible? Yeah, the wolpertinger were written the way they are specifically to show it's possible. <br /> <br /> Easy or common? Not at all. The wolpertinger came into being as Kithain under extraordinary circumstances at a price that even they can't remember. A new Kithain soul being created is sort of thing that drives an entire chronicle.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-19T08:53:00-07:00","id":1094573,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PookaKnight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1093870-new-fae-souls?p=1094518#post1094518\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Possible? Yeah, the wolpertinger were written the way they are specifically to show it's possible.<br /> <br /> Easy or common? Not at all. The wolpertinger came into being as Kithain under extraordinary circumstances at a price that even they can't remember. A new Kithain soul being created is sort of thing that drives an entire chronicle.</div> </div> </div> </div>Would it be accurate to say it is possible that ALL kiths started as chimera? And every time something feels the dreaming with glamour they become Kithain?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-19T09:32:24-07:00","id":1094591,"title":"","content":"If DA: Fae is accepted as the history of C:tD, then yeah, sprites were the the main way First Born reproduced. I'd imagine it's something that's been exceedingly rare since the Shattering though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-20T20:21:23-07:00","id":1095002,"title":"","content":"This is just a house rule but I would consider allowing a Mage who has Demesne 5 and Spirit 5 to at the least draw in the soul of a Kinain into his Demesne and combine the power he has within his realm with his Magick and Transform a sliver of his soul and Avatar (represented by a dot of perm willpower just as if he were creating a Talisman) into a Fae Mein completing the partially fairy soul of the Kinain. This is because Demesne 5 represents you having ascended to becoming a true lord of dreams and the soul of such a being should carry a certain weight in the Dreaming. Plus, if you can actually get something into your Demesne it should be pretty darn malleable to your will once it's in your own world.<br /> <br /> I might also require two quests from the Mage as offerings to the Dreaming. One quest to create Glamour, this representing the Seelie side of the soul you want to create, and one to destroy Banality, this represents the Unseelie side of the soul you are trying to create. Both quests must be potent enough that the Dreaming feels them and they can be used as components for a new Fairy soul.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-21T15:17:30-07:00","id":1095258,"title":"","content":"I still have seen nothing to indicate that fae are finite in number, though. While I would not say that new fae souls are common, I think making an entire chronicle about it is taking things a bit too far. I'm not referring to a new Kith, I'm talking about a single new soul as opposed to one that's been reborn here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3988-windthin","name":"Windthin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3988_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-21T17:48:59-07:00","id":1095306,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Windthin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1093870-new-fae-souls?p=1095258#post1095258\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think making an entire chronicle about it is taking things a bit too far.</div> </div> </div> </div>The whole premise of the game is that the fae are dying. Any new Kithain, even a single individual, are a Big Deal.<br /> <br /> You can, of course, run your own chronicle however you wish, but from my point of view, that changes one of the fundamentals of the game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-22T08:40:47-07:00","id":1095494,"title":"","content":"In my games the only new Fae are those disgorged from Arcadia during rare events. The birth of a new Fae into the actual world would be a momentous thing, that I might allow to a PC who has deeply touched the Dreaming. My players wonder if new Fae might be born in Arcadia but the question is largely academic... since there isn't a reliable back and forth. <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1383-yrtalien","name":"yrtalien","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-22T10:22:24-07:00","id":1095540,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>yrtalien</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1093870-new-fae-souls?p=1095494#post1095494\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In my games the only new Fae are those disgorged from Arcadia during rare events. The birth of a new Fae into the actual world would be a momentous thing, that I might allow to a PC who has deeply touched the Dreaming. My players wonder if new Fae might be born in Arcadia but the question is largely academic... since there isn't a reliable back and forth.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>That is how I would handle it in the context of a chronicle, as well. If someone wanted their longterm character spine to be the evolution from Kithain into Faerie Soul, that is definitely the stuff of a full story!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13420-gl1tterboots","name":"gl1tterboots","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"58"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}